-- 9. SELLING, RENTING OUT OR NOT MOVING IN (ss 153-155). HYPOTHETICAL: the home buyer of case 2 ($600,000, assessed
-- 12,850 under s 91; possession 1 August 2026, moved in 15 August 2026), and the first home buyer of case 3 (assessed
-- nil under s 92). C = 20,025 - 12,850 = 7,175 for the first, 20,025 - 0 = 20,025 for the second.
-- =====================================================================================================================

-- Leases the whole house from 1 March 2027, within the year after moving in: s 153. OD = 15 Aug 2026 to 1 Mar 2027
-- inclusive = 17 + 30 + 31 + 30 + 31 + 31 + 28 + 1 = 199. Notice by 1 March + 28 = 29 March 2027.
#ASSERT `What happens to my concession if I sell, rent out or do not move in` `the home concession (s 91)` 600000 12850 FALSE `1 Aug 2026` TRUE `15 Aug 2026` `a lease or other grant of exclusive possession of all of the land, or of part of it other than for residential purposes` `1 Mar 2027` FALSE `1 Mar 2027` EQUALS `the commissioner must reassess for further duty TD by the s 153(2) formula from C and OD, which is not in the deposited text` 7175 199
#ASSERT `By when must I tell the Commissioner` `the home concession (s 91)` 600000 12850 FALSE `1 Aug 2026` TRUE `15 Aug 2026` `a lease or other grant of exclusive possession of all of the land, or of part of it other than for residential purposes` `1 Mar 2027` FALSE `1 Mar 2027` EQUALS `notice must be given to the commissioner, and the instruments lodged, by` `29 Mar 2027`
-- Sold on 15 August 2027, the first anniversary of moving in: still within the year; OD = 365 + 1 = 366.
#ASSERT `What happens to my concession if I sell, rent out or do not move in` `the home concession (s 91)` 600000 12850 FALSE `1 Aug 2026` TRUE `15 Aug 2026` `a transfer of part or all of the land` `15 Aug 2027` FALSE `15 Aug 2027` EQUALS `the commissioner must reassess for further duty TD by the s 153(2) formula from C and OD, which is not in the deposited text` 7175 366
-- Sold on 16 August 2027: after the year; no reassessment and no notifiable event.
#ASSERT `What happens to my concession if I sell, rent out or do not move in` `the home concession (s 91)` 600000 12850 FALSE `1 Aug 2026` TRUE `15 Aug 2026` `a transfer of part or all of the land` `16 Aug 2027` FALSE `16 Aug 2027` EQUALS `nothing happens: the dealing and the occupation meet ss 153 and 154`
#ASSERT `By when must I tell the Commissioner` `the home concession (s 91)` 600000 12850 FALSE `1 Aug 2026` TRUE `15 Aug 2026` `a transfer of part or all of the land` `16 Aug 2027` FALSE `16 Aug 2027` EQUALS `no notice is required: no notifiable event has happened`
-- Lets a room from 1 December 2026: not a disposal (s 153(1C)), but a notifiable event: notice by 29 December 2026.
#ASSERT `What happens to my concession if I sell, rent out or do not move in` `the home concession (s 91)` 600000 12850 FALSE `1 Aug 2026` TRUE `15 Aug 2026` `a residential lease of part, but not all, of the land` `1 Dec 2026` FALSE `1 Dec 2026` EQUALS `nothing happens: the dealing and the occupation meet ss 153 and 154`
#ASSERT `By when must I tell the Commissioner` `the home concession (s 91)` 600000 12850 FALSE `1 Aug 2026` TRUE `15 Aug 2026` `a residential lease of part, but not all, of the land` `1 Dec 2026` FALSE `1 Dec 2026` EQUALS `notice must be given to the commissioner, and the instruments lodged, by` `29 Dec 2026`
-- Transfers half to a spouse on 1 December 2026 (exempt under s 151): not a disposal, but still notifiable.
#ASSERT `What happens to my concession if I sell, rent out or do not move in` `the home concession (s 91)` 600000 12850 FALSE `1 Aug 2026` TRUE `15 Aug 2026` `a transfer of part of the land to the transferee's spouse that is exempt under s 151` `1 Dec 2026` FALSE `1 Dec 2026` EQUALS `nothing happens: the dealing and the occupation meet ss 153 and 154`
#ASSERT `By when must I tell the Commissioner` `the home concession (s 91)` 600000 12850 FALSE `1 Aug 2026` TRUE `15 Aug 2026` `a transfer of part of the land to the transferee's spouse that is exempt under s 151` `1 Dec 2026` FALSE `1 Dec 2026` EQUALS `notice must be given to the commissioner, and the instruments lodged, by` `29 Dec 2026`
-- Flood destroys the house and the land is sold on 1 February 2027: an intervening event, no reassessment; notice is
-- still due 28 days later, 1 March 2027 (February 2027 has 28 days).
#ASSERT `What happens to my concession if I sell, rent out or do not move in` `the home concession (s 91)` 600000 12850 FALSE `1 Aug 2026` TRUE `15 Aug 2026` `a transfer of part or all of the land` `1 Feb 2027` TRUE `1 Feb 2027` EQUALS `nothing happens: what happened was because of an intervening event`
#ASSERT `By when must I tell the Commissioner` `the home concession (s 91)` 600000 12850 FALSE `1 Aug 2026` TRUE `15 Aug 2026` `a transfer of part or all of the land` `1 Feb 2027` TRUE `1 Feb 2027` EQUALS `notice must be given to the commissioner, and the instruments lodged, by` `1 Mar 2027`
-- The first home buyer never moves in; asked on 1 September 2027, after the first anniversary of possession (1 August
-- 2027): s 154(1)(b)(ii), reassessed as if no concession, further duty 20,025. The failure happens on 2 August 2027;
-- notice by 30 August 2027.
#ASSERT `What happens to my concession if I sell, rent out or do not move in` `the first home concession (s 92)` 600000 0 FALSE `1 Aug 2026` FALSE `1 Aug 2026` `no dealing with the land` `1 Aug 2026` FALSE `1 Sep 2027` EQUALS `the commissioner must reassess as if the concession had never applied (s 154): further duty, in dollars` 20025
#ASSERT `By when must I tell the Commissioner` `the first home concession (s 92)` 600000 0 FALSE `1 Aug 2026` FALSE `1 Aug 2026` `no dealing with the land` `1 Aug 2026` FALSE `1 Sep 2027` EQUALS `notice must be given to the commissioner, and the instruments lodged, by` `30 Aug 2027`
-- Asked on 1 March 2027 instead: there is still time, to 1 August 2027.
#ASSERT `What happens to my concession if I sell, rent out or do not move in` `the first home concession (s 92)` 600000 0 FALSE `1 Aug 2026` FALSE `1 Aug 2026` `no dealing with the land` `1 Aug 2026` FALSE `1 Mar 2027` EQUALS `nothing happens yet: the residence may still be occupied up to and including` `1 Aug 2027`
#ASSERT `By when must I tell the Commissioner` `the first home concession (s 92)` 600000 0 FALSE `1 Aug 2026` FALSE `1 Aug 2026` `no dealing with the land` `1 Aug 2026` FALSE `1 Mar 2027` EQUALS `no notice is required yet: if the residence is not occupied by this day, notice is due 28 days after the next day` `1 Aug 2027`
-- Moves in late, on 2 September 2027: s 154(1)(b)(ii); notice by 30 August 2027.
#ASSERT `What happens to my concession if I sell, rent out or do not move in` `the first home concession (s 92)` 600000 0 FALSE `1 Aug 2026` TRUE `2 Sep 2027` `no dealing with the land` `2 Sep 2027` FALSE `2 Sep 2027` EQUALS `the commissioner must reassess as if the concession had never applied (s 154): further duty, in dollars` 20025
-- Lets the whole house to a tenant from 1 September 2026, then moves in on 1 March 2027 (within the year): a disposal
-- before the occupation date (s 154(1)(b)(i), (2)(b)); full reassessment, 20,025. Notice by 29 September 2026.
#ASSERT `What happens to my concession if I sell, rent out or do not move in` `the first home concession (s 92)` 600000 0 FALSE `1 Aug 2026` TRUE `1 Mar 2027` `a lease or other grant of exclusive possession of all of the land, or of part of it other than for residential purposes` `1 Sep 2026` FALSE `1 Mar 2027` EQUALS `the commissioner must reassess as if the concession had never applied (s 154): further duty, in dollars` 20025
#ASSERT `By when must I tell the Commissioner` `the first home concession (s 92)` 600000 0 FALSE `1 Aug 2026` TRUE `1 Mar 2027` `a lease or other grant of exclusive possession of all of the land, or of part of it other than for residential purposes` `1 Sep 2026` FALSE `1 Mar 2027` EQUALS `notice must be given to the commissioner, and the instruments lodged, by` `29 Sep 2026`
-- Lets only a room, before moving in: s 154(2)(b) covers a lease of "part or all", and s 154 has no counterpart to
-- s 153(1C): full reassessment, 20,025.
#ASSERT `What happens to my concession if I sell, rent out or do not move in` `the first home concession (s 92)` 600000 0 FALSE `1 Aug 2026` TRUE `1 Oct 2026` `a residential lease of part, but not all, of the land` `1 Sep 2026` FALSE `1 Oct 2026` EQUALS `the commissioner must reassess as if the concession had never applied (s 154): further duty, in dollars` 20025
-- Vacant land (s 92B) not yet built on, asked 1 September 2027: 2 years run to 1 August 2028.
#ASSERT `What happens to my concession if I sell, rent out or do not move in` `the first home vacant land concession (s 92B)` 400000 0 TRUE `1 Aug 2026` FALSE `1 Aug 2026` `no dealing with the land` `1 Aug 2026` FALSE `1 Sep 2027` EQUALS `nothing happens yet: the residence may still be occupied up to and including` `1 Aug 2028`
-- No concession: nothing, and no notice.
#ASSERT `What happens to my concession if I sell, rent out or do not move in` `no home concession` 600000 20025 FALSE `1 Aug 2026` TRUE `15 Aug 2026` `a transfer of part or all of the land` `1 Mar 2027` FALSE `1 Mar 2027` EQUALS `nothing happens: the duty was not assessed with a home concession`
#ASSERT `By when must I tell the Commissioner` `no home concession` 600000 20025 FALSE `1 Aug 2026` TRUE `15 Aug 2026` `a transfer of part or all of the land` `1 Mar 2027` FALSE `1 Mar 2027` EQUALS `no notice is required: the duty was not assessed with a home concession`

-- s 155(2): notice on day 28 is in time.
#ASSERT EVALTRACE `s 155(2) -- within 28 days after a notifiable event, the transferee must notify the commissioner and have the instruments lodged` 0 (LIST (EVENT `the transferee` `give the commissioner notice in the approved form and have the instruments lodged for a reassessment` 28)) EQUALS FULFILLED
