#ASSERT `How much vehicle registration duty must I pay` `an application to register the vehicle` FALSE TRUE 60000 0 60000 60000 FALSE 0 `a hybrid vehicle, with any number of cylinders` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE `none of these` EQUALS `the vehicle registration duty, in dollars, is` 1200
-- A special vehicle: $25 (s 382(2)(a)).
#ASSERT `How much vehicle registration duty must I pay` `an application to register the vehicle` FALSE TRUE 80000 0 80000 80000 FALSE 0 `a vehicle with 5 or 6 cylinders` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE `none of these` EQUALS `the vehicle registration duty, in dollars, is` 25
-- A used van modified for a wheelchair user, market value $50,000 of which $15,000 is the modifications, bought for
-- $52,000: s 378(3)(b) the market value without the modifications, 35,000 (the price is not used); 350 x 3 = 1,050.
#ASSERT `What is the dutiable value of my vehicle` `an application to transfer the vehicle to another person` TRUE FALSE 0 0 52000 50000 TRUE 15000 EQUALS 35000
#ASSERT `How much vehicle registration duty must I pay` `an application to transfer the vehicle to another person` TRUE FALSE 0 0 52000 50000 TRUE 15000 `a vehicle with 1 to 4 cylinders` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE `none of these` EQUALS `the vehicle registration duty, in dollars, is` 1050
-- A mother gives her daughter her registered car: s 390(2) (a child of the registered operator is a relative, s 379A(d)).
#ASSERT `How much vehicle registration duty must I pay` `an application to transfer the vehicle to another person` TRUE FALSE 0 0 0 15000 FALSE 0 `a vehicle with 1 to 4 cylinders` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE `a child, stepchild or grandchild of the registered operator` EQUALS `no vehicle registration duty is imposed` `exempt: a transfer wholly by way of gift to a relative of the registered operator (s 390(2))`
-- The same gift to a friend: duty on the greater of 0 and 15,000; 150 x 3 = 450.
#ASSERT `How much vehicle registration duty must I pay` `an application to transfer the vehicle to another person` TRUE FALSE 0 0 0 15000 FALSE 0 `a vehicle with 1 to 4 cylinders` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE `none of these` EQUALS `the vehicle registration duty, in dollars, is` 450
-- Sold to the daughter for $10,000: not wholly a gift; duty on the greater of 10,000 and 15,000: 450.
#ASSERT `How much vehicle registration duty must I pay` `an application to transfer the vehicle to another person` TRUE FALSE 0 0 10000 15000 FALSE 0 `a vehicle with 1 to 4 cylinders` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE `a child, stepchild or grandchild of the registered operator` EQUALS `the vehicle registration duty, in dollars, is` 450
-- An ex-serviceperson entitled to concessional registration fees: s 390(1)(j).
#ASSERT `How much vehicle registration duty must I pay` `an application to register the vehicle` FALSE TRUE 40000 0 40000 40000 FALSE 0 `a vehicle with 1 to 4 cylinders` FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE `none of these` EQUALS `no vehicle registration duty is imposed` `exempt: an ex-serviceperson entitled to concessional registration fees (s 390(1)(j))`
-- Lost the use of a leg, car for getting to work: s 390(1)(l).
#ASSERT `How much vehicle registration duty must I pay` `an application to register the vehicle` FALSE TRUE 40000 0 40000 40000 FALSE 0 `a vehicle with 1 to 4 cylinders` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE `none of these` EQUALS `no vehicle registration duty is imposed` `exempt: a person who has lost the use of a leg, travelling to and from work (s 390(1)(l))`
-- A motorised wheelchair: s 390(1)(k).
#ASSERT `How much vehicle registration duty must I pay` `an application to register the vehicle` FALSE TRUE 9000 0 9000 9000 FALSE 0 `an electric vehicle` FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE `none of these` EQUALS `no vehicle registration duty is imposed` `exempt: a motorised wheelchair for a disabled person's use (s 390(1)(k))`
-- A 4-rotor engine is not in Schedule 4C: not covered.
#ASSERT `How much vehicle registration duty must I pay` `an application to register the vehicle` FALSE TRUE 70000 0 70000 70000 FALSE 0 `a vehicle of another kind` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE `none of these` EQUALS `not covered: Schedule 4C does not list this kind of vehicle`

-- s 381: paid when applying; on a transfer, either the transferee or the transferor paying discharges it.
#ASSERT EVALTRACE (`s 381 -- the vehicle registration duty must be paid when the application is made` `an application to register the vehicle`) 0 (LIST (EVENT `the applicant or transferee` `pay the vehicle registration duty` 0)) EQUALS FULFILLED
#ASSERT EVALTRACE (`s 381 -- the vehicle registration duty must be paid when the application is made` `an application to transfer the vehicle to another person`) 0 (LIST (EVENT `the transferor` `pay the vehicle registration duty` 0)) EQUALS FULFILLED
-- expect: BREACH BY the applicant or transferee, "s 381(1): ..." (not paid with the application)
#TRACE `s 381 -- the vehicle registration duty must be paid when the application is made` `an application to register the vehicle` AT 0 WITH
    (WAITUNTIL 1)
